{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "在欢送抗大总校深入敌后所指示的“三个法宝”（一九三九年）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n123）\n在欢送抗大总校深入敌后所指示的“三个法宝”\n（一九三九年）\n坚持统一战线；开展游击战争；巩固内部团结。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-57a0b8ea572b0cdc8645", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-124.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "4baf272b3340577931357cb391bdcb46f15b3bcabd21a2fdd936577dd4b54963", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 2, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "ba5370e635c8ff569eb926300affed98e00c0856a43c3e2b1a0219742d7f7a6b", "text_chars": 134}
